  "notes": "Drafted by Claude 5 Oct; re-clicked by Pearl 7 Oct (54 new dots, incl. the far rows the draft skipped). Her dots all landed in row 1 (the tool then added clicks to the selected row), so Claude regrouped them into 8 rows on 7 Oct by the curve each row follows, without moving any dot; her saved file is in data/backup/level1_camera2_P3.clicked_7oct.json. Layout from 30 Sep 11:00 (camera 2 was moved then). Rows are channels, numbered by distance from camera 2: row 1 = the top-edge row (farthest), row 8 = nearest. Pearl then corrected it again on 7 Oct (added row 2 H06 at the plant below R01-H07, re-placed some row 1-3 dots); all 6 checks pass. Dots are plant bases.",
